@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082

### 1. Crear producto: Arroz (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arroz 5 kg",
  "description": "Arroz blanco de grano largo",
  "price": 6.50,
  "stock": 10
}

### 2. Crear producto: Aceite (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aceite 1 L",
  "description": "Aceite vegetal",
  "price": 3.25,
  "stock": 5
}

### 3. Listar productos (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 4. Consultar el producto 1 (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### 5. Actualizar precio del producto 1 (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arroz 5 kg",
  "description": "Arroz blanco de grano largo",
  "price": 6.75,
  "stock": 10
}

### 6. Datos inválidos (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "stock": -1
}

### 7. Producto que no existe (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999

### 8. Descontar stock: 2 arroces y 1 aceite (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/decrease-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 9. Stock insuficiente: TODO O NADA (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/decrease-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 3 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 100 }
  ]
}

### 10. Comprobar el rollback: el arroz debe seguir en 8, no en 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
